'''Bebe''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.1 Update#Version 14.1.1 Update|Version 14.1.1]] increases attack and time between attacks, shortens attack animation, and adds [[Multi-Hit]], [[Barrier Breaker]] and [[Dodge Attack|Dodge]].

